# Verify pad-right is NOT available without [include %libdir "strings.llt"]
# Uses try to capture the undefined-variable error as a value.

[try [fn [] [pad-right "hi" 5 " "]]]
=== out
Variant(Result.Error, String("undefined variable: pad-right (did you mean the string \"pad-right\"? Use quotes.)"))

=== warn
[UndefinedVariable] undefined variable: pad-right
